The next step should keep the same names and visual order. A person opening a room's heating controls can then find the current reading, target temperature and supported actions without learning a new layout. More detailed settings remain available when needed.

Controls must reflect the actual device. A dashboard cannot promise a heating mode, schedule or remote action that an integration does not provide. A pending request, unavailable reading or permission limit needs an honest explanation and an appropriate next step.

